    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lead Capture → Google Sheet + Slack\nCatches leads from any website form, filters out junk and bots, saves them to a Google Sheet (no duplicates) and pings your team on Slack.\n\n### Setup\n1. Create a Google Sheet with a tab named **Leads** and the header row from `sheet-Leads.csv` (or import that file).\n2. Copy the sheet ID from its URL (`docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/`**`THIS_PART`**`/edit`) into **Config → sheetId**.\n3. In **Config**, set your Slack channel ID (right-click channel → *View channel details* → bottom of the window) and timezone.\n4. Pick your **Google Sheets** credential on *Save Lead to Sheet* and your **Slack** credential on *Notify Team on Slack*. Invite the Slack bot to the channel (`/invite @YourBot`).\n5. Activate the workflow, then copy the **Production URL** from the *Lead Webhook* node.\n6. Point your website form at that URL (POST). See the HTML snippet below if your builder doesn't have a \"webhook\" option.\n\nFull guide: README.md in this workflow's folder.",
        "height": 606,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 7
      },
